# Vigie is authored with LF endings. core.autocrlf=true on Windows would
# otherwise rewrite checked-out text to CRLF on the next checkout, which breaks
# the minimal sources.yaml parser (it splits on a literal "\n") and the
# pipeline's stamped filenames. Keep text LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Real binaries must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
